            "detailed_description": "Developed by a team of experienced modders from the Paradox forum, Darkest Hour is a stand-alone Hearts of Iron game. The game features a mixture of short and in-depth campaigns set across the darkest chapters of the 20th century. Play from the outbreak of the Great War up until the onset of the Cold War. <br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tDarkest Hour will introduce a new artificial intelligence that is now able to react to hundreds of different situations simultaneously. It implements a dynamic diplomatic system that will allow the player to have a real impact on the course of history.<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short and grand campaigns allow players to experience the darkest hours of the 20th century, from the Great War to the onset of the Cold War<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>New map, redesigned to offer greater detail as well as strategic and tactical opportunities<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Dynamic diplomatic system giving the player greater influence on the course of events<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>New artificial intelligence capable of reacting to hundreds of different situations<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scenarios:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\tGrand campaign scenarios (where it is possible to choose any of the nations involved):<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1914 The Great War (starting on June 27, 1914)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1933 Day of Decision (starting on March 4, 1933)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1936 The Road to Another War (starting on January 1, 1936)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1939 Invasion of Poland (starting on September 1, 1939)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1940 Burning Europe (starting on May 10, 1940)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1941 Awakening the Giant (starting on June 22, 1941)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1942 Enemy at the Gate (starting on November 22, 1942)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1943 Allied Invasion of Sicily (starting on July 26, 1943)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1944 Allied Landing in Normandy (starting on June 20, 1944)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1945 Battle of the Bulge (starting on December 16, 1944)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\tBattle scenarios which focus on specific battles or wars and where players can choose between a small number of nations:<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1904 Russo-Japanese War<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>1939 Invasion of Poland<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
