                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What I would do for a remaster of this game. Even just the ability to make the text more legible and a bit larger would be good enough for me. \n\nThis is one of the most well balanced grand strategy games ever made. It's not too complex and not too micro intensive, just enough to allow deep strategy without bogging you down in non stop chores as other games in the genre do. It's age lends itself to the immersive quality of the game instead of dating it harshly as you might think before you actually get into it. The one issue I have is that the fonts are not able to be scaled up at all. So you will likely want to lower the resolution for easier reading of events/UI, which in turn makes the text slightly blurry. Still a great game that is playable if mildly annoying at times due to my eyes not being the best.",
